  "stem": "John is a four-year-old boy who has recently returned from a school excursion. His mother mentions that since he has come back, his sleep has been unsettled. He has been waking two or three times a week between 10 pm and 12 am, when he sits up, stares and screams. He is inconsolable for about 10 minutes. What is the most likely cause?",
